    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d638">

                <pb facs="0795" n="721" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v01/pg721"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/4489</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Petrograd</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-05-07T17:00:00+02:31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 7, 1917, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received May 9, 2 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1256. Bratiano, Roumanian Minister for
                    Foreign Affairs and President of Parliament, here asking whether Roumanian
                    Legation under Chargé d’Affaires be received by our Government; also says <pb
                        facs="0796" n="722" xml:id="pg722"/> large numbers Roumanians in America who
                    are Austro-Hungarian subjects, some naturalized, others not, intimating that
                    many of them desire to join our Army and asks whether they would be accepted and
                    if so whether be permitted to form Roumanian or Transylvanian regiment or
                    brigade. Answer.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
